    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"severely constrained\" is a pretty strong way to put it. So what you're saying is that the old way of arguing for public safety interests basically doesn't hold water anymore in court? Like, is the historical tradition test just a way to shut down most common sense regulations?",
